  m_text: Every town and settlement has its own doctor. Ranging from herbalists and
    shamans to experienced surgeons. They will help heal wounded soldiers and revive
    those who are almost dead, but, of course, not for free. The higher the doctor's
    skill, the more health they can restore to wounded units and the higher the chance
    of reviving fighters on the first try. The cost of treatment directly depends
    on the player's level.
