  m_text: A warrior without good weapons is not a warrior. A weaponsmith will help
    you put your weapons in order, sharpen them, remove rust, strengthen and adjust
    their balance. Some masters deal not only with cold weapons but also with firearms.
    The higher the level of the weaponsmith, the more exotic weapons they will be
    able to improve.
