  m_text: A good armorer is always invaluable, everywhere. They polish armor, tighten
    buckles, and patch up. Moreover, they can significantly improve and strengthen
    your armor. Novice craftsmen usually work on guards' equipment, but skilled masters
    will gladly take on even the most unique and unusual armor.
